<p>Q - Up to 15 characters representing the name of the listed company</p>
<p>S&nbsp;- Secondary listing indicator</p>
<p>W&nbsp;- Companies with weighted voting right structures&nbsp;indicator</p>
<p class="spanHeading"><span>B - Indicator for Biotech companies that <strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">did not apply</span></strong> and demonstrate to the Exchange's satisfaction that they are able to meet the requirements of <a href="https://en-rules.hkex.com.hk/node/2308">Listing Rule 8.05</a></span></p>
<p>P -&nbsp;Indicator for Pre-Commercial Specialist Technology companies that do not meet the revenue requirements of <a href="https://en-rules.hkex.com.hk/rulebook/18c03">Listing Rule 18C.03(4)</a></p>
<p>R - Indicator for products traded in Renminbi (RMB)</p>
<p>RS - Securities which are restricted securities (RS) under US federal securities laws.<br />
Please click <a rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.hkex.com.hk/-/media/HKEX-Market/Listing/Rules-and-Guidance/Other-Resources/Listing-of-Overseas-Companies/Understanding-the-Risks-of-Investing-in-Overseas-Issuers/Regulation_S_e.pdf" target="_blank">here</a> for explanation of RS</p>
<p>PF - Indicator for companies that have had a Significant Public Float Shortfall under <a rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://en-rules.hkex.com.hk/rulebook/1332f" target="_blank">Main Board Listing Rule 13.32F</a> / <a rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://en-rules.hkex.com.hk/rulebook/1737f" target="_blank">GEM Listing Rule 17.37F</a> and have not yet re-complied with the minimum public float required under <a rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://en-rules.hkex.com.hk/rulebook/1332b" target="_blank">Main Board Listing Rule 13.32B</a> / <a rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://en-rules.hkex.com.hk/rulebook/1737b" target="_blank">GEM Rule 17.37B</a></p>
</div>
</div>
